00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:06,000
What if you wished everyone - and everything - would just go away!

2
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:06,000
Nothing is a comedy, fantasy, science fiction film directed by Vincenzo Natali.

3
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:06,000
The film tells the story of two good friends who live together, Andrew, an agoraphobic travel agent who works
from his home, and Dave, a loser who works in an office where he is treated with contempt.

4
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:06,000
Just when it seems things can't get any worse for the two, the entire world outside
of their house disappears and is replaced with an endless white void.

